changeSet.comment:
Update Shopee to use redirect service (s.shopee.vn/an_redir) instead of link template.
According to Shopee official documentation (https://help.shopee.vn/portal/10/article/172955), the correct format is: https://s.shopee.vn/an_redir?origin_link={ENCODED_URL}&affiliate_id={ID}&sub_id={TRACKING}
This requires URL encoding the ENTIRE product URL, so we cannot use simple template placeholders. Link building is now handled by ShopeeAffiliateLinkBuilder in code.
